0.1.0-alpha.1
  - Initial alpha release of foscam-glance custom card for Foscam IP cameras
  - Live RTSP streaming and snapshot viewing
  - On-screen PTZ D-pad overlay on hover (desktop) or tap toggle (mobile)
  - Preset position quick-action buttons
  - Saved clips library modal with HTTP 206 range request scrubbing and seeking
  - Motion detection toggle badge and sensor glance controls
  - Modern modular Rollup build pipeline
